# Minimal non-destructive smoke walk: screenshot Home, move the selection
# down and back up, screenshotting each state. No CONFIRM presses, so no
# activity is entered and no device state is mutated.
#
#   uv run python scripts/device_walk.py run scripts/walks/example.walk --outdir runs/smoke

shot home
press DOWN
shot home-selection-down
press UP
shot home-selection-restored
